{"beat": 25, "name": "THE CATALOGUE RODE THE CARD", "text": "There's a quieter number in the Joint Committee's report, and it may matter more than the parcels. The catalogue itself was mail. A postmaster in Iowa told the committee that a 3-pound Sears catalogue had cost 24 cents to mail before catalogues were let into the parcel post. After, it cost 10 cents to reach his office. And the committee found that one firm alone had saved approximately $1,000,000 a year in postage from that change. The card didn't only cut the cost of delivering an order. It cut the cost of asking for one. Every book that landed on a farm table was a store opened in somebody's kitchen, and the card had made opening it far cheaper.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "There's", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.22}, {"word": "a", "start": 0.22, "end": 0.38}, {"word": "quieter", "start": 0.38, "end": 0.72}, {"word": "number", "start": 0.72, "end": 1.12}, {"word": "in", "start": 1.12, "end": 1.34}, {"word": "the", "start": 1.34, "end": 1.44}, {"word": "Joint", "start": 1.44, "end": 1.74}, {"word": "Committee's", "start": 1.74, "end": 2.36}, {"word": "report,", "start": 2.36, "end": 2.76}, {"word": "and", "start": 3.2, "end": 3.4}, {"word": "it", "start": 3.4, "end": 3.48}, {"word": "may", "start": 3.48, "end": 3.66}, {"word": "matter", "start": 3.66, "end": 4.04}, {"word": "more", "start": 4.04, "end": 4.32}, {"word": "than", "start": 4.32, "end": 4.5}, {"word": "the", "start": 4.5, "end": 4.64}, {"word": "parcels.", "start": 4.64, "end": 5.12}, {"word": "The", "start": 5.84, "end": 5.96}, {"word": "catalogue", "start": 5.96, "end": 6.38}, {"word": "itself", "start": 6.38, "end": 6.88}, {"word": "was", "start": 6.88, "end": 7.28}, {"word": "mail.", "start": 7.28, "end": 7.62}, {"word": "A", "start": 8.28, "end": 8.42}, {"word": "postmaster", "start": 8.42, "end": 8.96}, {"word": "in", "start": 8.96, "end": 9.3}, {"word": "Iowa", "start": 9.3, "end": 9.68}, {"word": "told", "start": 9.68, "en